			"notes": "## Minecraft Wiki Mod v1.0.0\n\nMinecraft Wiki Mod v1.0.0 is now available.\n\n### Features\n\n* Search the Minecraft Wiki directly from within Minecraft.\n* View Minecraft Wiki pages in an in-game browser.\n* Support for multiple Wiki categories.\n* Configurable Wiki language.\n* Configurable search behavior.\n* In-game web browsing powered by MCEF Modern.\n\n### Supported Versions\n\n* Minecraft: 1.21.10, 1.21.11, 26.1.2, 26.2\n* Mod Loader: Fabric\n\n### Dependencies\n\n* [[Fabric API on Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api)](https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api)\n* [[MCEF Modern on Modrinth](https://modrinth.com/mod/mcef-modern)](https://modrinth.com/mod/mcef-modern)\n\n### Installation\n\n1. Install Fabric Loader.\n2. Install the required dependencies listed above.\n3. Download the appropriate `.jar` file for your Minecraft version from the assets below.\n4. Place the `.jar` file in your Minecraft `mods` directory.\n5. Launch Minecraft with the Fabric profile.\n\n### Notes\n\nThis is the first public release of Minecraft Wiki Mod.\n\nIf you encounter bugs or have feature suggestions, please report them through [[GitHub Issues](https://github.com/Piscescup/mc-wiki-mod/issues)](https://github.com/Piscescup/mc-wiki-mod/issues)."
		}
